_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_printingwebpagelayout","name":"PrintingWebpageLayout","displayName":"Sets layout for printing (User)","categoryId":"6b71fbf6-7156-471a-b488-3eece04bda86","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/microsoft_edgev93~Policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~Printing_recommended/PrintingWebpageLayout_recommended","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended","uxBehavior":"default","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_0","displayName":"Sets layout option as portrait","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_1","displayName":"Sets layout option as landscape","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationSimpleSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings","name":"PrintPreviewStickySettings","displayName":"Configure the sticky print preview settings (User)","categoryId":"6b71fbf6-7156-471a-b488-3eece04bda86","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/microsoft_edgev110~Policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~Printing_recommended/PrintPreviewStickySettings_recommended","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended","uxBehavior":"default","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"dependedOnBy":[]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended","name":"PrintingWebpageLayout_recommended","displayName":"Sets layout for printing","description":"Configuring  this   policy  sets  the  layout  for  printing  webpages.\r\n\r\nIf  you  disable  or  don't  configure  this  policy,  users  can  decide  whether  to  print  webpages  in  Portrait  or  Landscape  layout.\r\n\r\nIf  you  enable  this  policy,  the  selected  option  is  set  as  the  layout  option.\r\n\r\nPolicy options mapping:\r\n\r\n* portrait (0) = Sets layout option as portrait\r\n\r\n* landscape (1) = Sets layout option as landscape\r\n\r\nUse the preceding information when configuring this policy.","categoryId":"6b71fbf6-7156-471a-b488-3eece04bda86","baseUri":"./Device/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/microsoft_edgev93~Policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~Printing_recommended/PrintingWebpageLayout_recommended","rootDefinitionId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_0","options":[{"itemId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[{"dependedOnBy":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_printingwebpagelayout","required":true}]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended","name":"PrintingWebpageLayout_recommended","displayName":"Sets layout for printing (User)","description":"Configuring  this   policy  sets  the  layout  for  printing  webpages.\r\n\r\nIf  you  disable  or  don't  configure  this  policy,  users  can  decide  whether  to  print  webpages  in  Portrait  or  Landscape  layout.\r\n\r\nIf  you  enable  this  policy,  the  selected  option  is  set  as  the  layout  option.\r\n\r\nPolicy options mapping:\r\n\r\n* portrait (0) = Sets layout option as portrait\r\n\r\n* landscape (1) = Sets layout option as landscape\r\n\r\nUse the preceding information when configuring this policy.","categoryId":"6b71fbf6-7156-471a-b488-3eece04bda86","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/microsoft_edgev93~Policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~Printing_recommended/PrintingWebpageLayout_recommended","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[{"dependedOnBy":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev93~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printingwebpagelayout_recommended_printingwebpagelayout","required":true}]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended","name":"PrintPreviewStickySettings_recommended","displayName":"Configure the sticky print preview settings","description":"Configuring this policy sets the print preview settings as the most recent choice in Print Preview instead of the default print preview settings.\r\n\r\nEach item of this policy expects a boolean:\r\n\r\nLayout specifies if the webpage layout should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the webpage layout uses the recent choice otherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nSize specifies if the page size should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the page size uses the recent choice otherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nScale Type specifies if the scaling percentage and scale type should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the scale percentage and scale type both uses the recent choice oherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nMargins specifies if the page margin should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the page margins uses the recent choice otherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nIf you enable this policy, the selected values will use the most recent choice in Print Preview.\r\n\r\nIf you disable or don't configure this policy, print preview settings will not be impacted.\r\n\r\nExample value:\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"layout\": false,\r\n  \"margins\": true,\r\n  \"scaleType\": false,\r\n  \"size\": true\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nCompact example value:\r\n\r\n{\"layout\": false, \"margins\": true, \"scaleType\": false, \"size\": true}","categoryId":"6b71fbf6-7156-471a-b488-3eece04bda86","baseUri":"./Device/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/microsoft_edgev110~Policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~Printing_recommended/PrintPreviewStickySettings_recommended","rootDefinitionId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended_0","options":[{"itemId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[{"dependedOnBy":"device_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings","required":true}]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edge~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewusesystemdefaultprinter_recommended","name":"PrintPreviewUseSystemDefaultPrinter_recommended","displayName":"Set the system default printer as the default printer (User)","description":"Tells Microsoft Edge to use the system default printer as the default choice in Print Preview instead of the most recently used printer.\r\n\r\nIf you disable this policy or don't configure it, Print Preview uses the most recently used printer as the default destination choice.\r\n\r\nIf you enable this policy, Print Preview uses the OS system default printer as the default destination choice.","categoryId":"6b71fbf6-7156-471a-b488-3eece04bda86","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/microsoft_edge~Policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~Printing_recommended/PrintPreviewUseSystemDefaultPrinter_recommended","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edge~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewusesystemdefaultprinter_recommended","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edge~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewusesystemdefaultprinter_recommended_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edge~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewusesystemdefaultprinter_recommended_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edge~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewusesystemdefaultprinter_recommended_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended","name":"PrintPreviewStickySettings_recommended","displayName":"Configure the sticky print preview settings (User)","description":"Configuring this policy sets the print preview settings as the most recent choice in Print Preview instead of the default print preview settings.\r\n\r\nEach item of this policy expects a boolean:\r\n\r\nLayout specifies if the webpage layout should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the webpage layout uses the recent choice otherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nSize specifies if the page size should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the page size uses the recent choice otherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nScale Type specifies if the scaling percentage and scale type should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the scale percentage and scale type both uses the recent choice oherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nMargins specifies if the page margin should be kept sticky or not in print preview settings. If we set this to True the page margins uses the recent choice otherwise it will set to default value.\r\n\r\nIf you enable this policy, the selected values will use the most recent choice in Print Preview.\r\n\r\nIf you disable or don't configure this policy, print preview settings will not be impacted.\r\n\r\nExample value:\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"layout\": false,\r\n  \"margins\": true,\r\n  \"scaleType\": false,\r\n  \"size\": true\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nCompact example value:\r\n\r\n{\"layout\": false, \"margins\": true, \"scaleType\": false, \"size\": true}","categoryId":"6b71fbf6-7156-471a-b488-3eece04bda86","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/microsoft_edgev110~Policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~Printing_recommended/PrintPreviewStickySettings_recommended","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~microsoft_edge_recommended~printing_recommended_printpreviewstickysettings_recommended_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_microsoft_edgev110~policy~micr